# Screenshot-to-feature (mandatory)

When screenshots are provided, NEVER start writing UI or implementation code.

Mandatory order:
1. Deep analysis of all screenshots
2. Extract screens, user flows, visible data, states, and actions
3. Group into clear features
4. Propose Domain Use Cases for each feature
5. Present features + Use Cases and WAIT for explicit approval

Only after approval: create `feature/<name>` and implement (Clean Architecture + tests).

```text
❌ BAD — build pages from a screenshot immediately
✅ GOOD — analyze → features + use cases → wait → then implement on a feature branch
```
